\details{
Provides methods for placing, cancelling, and querying USD-M futures orders,
managing positions, leverage, and margin on Binance. Inherits from \link{BinanceBase}.
\subsection{Purpose and Scope}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Order Management}: Place, cancel, and query futures orders.
\item \strong{Position Management}: View positions, set leverage, margin type, and position mode.
\item \strong{Account Queries}: Retrieve account info, balances, trades, and income history.
}
}

\subsection{Usage}{

All methods require authentication (valid API key and secret).
The base URL defaults to \verb{https://fapi.binance.com} via \code{\link[=get_futures_base_url]{get_futures_base_url()}}.
}

